            <p class="text-lg font-normal text-gray-200 lg:text-xl max-w-[80%]">
            The Pagadian City Unemployment Monitoring System is a web-based platform designed to track and visualize real-time unemployment data at the barangay level. With integrated geographic mapping and social media dissemination via Facebook, the system enhances how unemployment trends are understood, shared, and addressed within the city.
