    <div id="overview" class="bg-white w-screen h-auto pt-30 px-8">
        <div class="px-40">
            <h1
                class="mb-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
                System <span class="underline underline-offset-3 decoration-5 decoration-emerald-400">Overview</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl font-normal text-black">
                The Unemployment Monitoring System Through Mapping with Real-Time Update Using Social Media Platforms is a web-based solution developed to address the growing need for accurate, timely, and location-specific unemployment data in Pagadian City, Zamboanga del Sur. This system empowers local government units, barangay officials, and the general public by providing a centralized platform for tracking and analyzing unemployment trends across different barangays.
                <br><br>Leveraging interactive geographic mapping, the system visualizes the concentration of unemployed individuals by location, making it easier to identify areas most in need of intervention. Additionally, the system is integrated with Facebook, enabling the automated posting of summarized unemployment data, thus ensuring transparency and wide public access through familiar digital channels.
                <br><br>Designed with usability and accessibility in mind, the system features secure modules for authorized users to input and manage unemployment records. This automation replaces traditional manual reporting methods, resulting in improved accuracy, reduced administrative workload, and faster data dissemination.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center mt-5 p-4 mb-4 text-sm text-green-800 rounded-lg bg-green-50" role="alert">
